  "guid": "com.vinarators.compasshud",
  "name": "Compass HUD",
  "slug": "compass-hud",
  "teaser": "Adds a compass at the top of the screen during a raid, with customization options",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/gBFljRq8g1Pnb0R5MXzFKl3bzSd5ldp4Nixpndyx.png",
  "downloads": 2808,
  "favourites_count": 24,
  "description": "<h3>A clean and optimized horizontal compass for your tactical overlay.</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/RmzHGsuw.png\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/t2lYKn5T.png\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\n<h2>Video demonstration:</h2>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"jOnAY6bVqLc\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jOnAY6bVqLc?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jOnAY6bVqLc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h1>Features:</h1>\n<h5>Sleek Aesthetic: Just looks good</h5>\n<h5>Auto-Hide: Automatically vanishes when you open your inventory or start looting to keep your UI clear.</h5>\n<h5>Hotkey Toggle: Quickly hide or show the HUD mid-raid by pressing F8.</h5>\n<h5>Supports both English and Russian localization layouts.</h5>\n<h1>Configuration (F12):</h1>\n<h5>Tweak scale, opacity, and the side-fading look on the fly.</h5>\n<h5>Toggle ribbon numbers or letters independently.</h5>\n<h5>The ability to toggle the display of extracts, some missions, and transitions to the following locations</h5>\n<h5>Swich English and Russian localization layouts.</h5>\n<h5>And other settings…</h5>\n<p><em>Note: Not all quest markers are displayed yet.</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/u1LlSytv.png\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\n<p>If you find any bugs or have suggestions for new features, I’d be happy to hear your feedback.</p>\n",
